msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "(No point eating now. I'm not even hungry.)"
msgstr "(Inutile mangiare adesso. Non ho neanche fame.)"

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Thanks! Come again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "That's all right. Please come again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"Thanks for coming here so often. I hope our Okinawan soba fills you with the"
" energy you need to give it your all today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid ""
"Take a look at me. I eat our rafute every day, and not only am I full of "
"energy, my skin's baby soft!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"Apparently eating rafute's good for your skin. I heard someone say it's "
"because of the collagen or somethin'."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"Hey, you should bring a friend with you the next time you stop by! I sure "
"hope it's soon!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"(So this rafute soba is packed full of collagen, huh? I should remember this"
" when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

